# `analytics.session_turns`

Per-turn cost/token/timing breakdown for a session.

**Policy** — read (C0, safe). Capability `ship.analytics.read`.

## Arguments

| name | type |
|------|------|
| `session_key` | `string` |

## Returns

`AnalyticsSessionTurnsResponse` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `turns` | `map` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call analytics.session_turns --json '{ "session_key": "" }'
```

Kind: read.

## Example response

```json
{
  "turns": [
    {
      "id": "turn-001",
      "session_key": "sess-rust-lane-1",
      "actor_id": "actor-rust-lane-harbor",
